        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur NEWWIN, Newport Rose With Windsor Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe ornate styling of Newport Rosette With Windsor Knob makes it both a standout and a standard in decorative door hardware. The Windsor Knobset is a prime example of tasteful elegance. It has a stately look without being gaudy. The Newport's Rosette design combined with the ornate Windsor Knob with Newport Rose will enhance the elegance of your home in any of the beautiful finish choices. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-newport-series\"><b>Newport Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur NEWWIN Newport Rosette With Windsor Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Newport Rose With Windsor Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Newport Rosette Diameter: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Windsor Knob Diameter: 2.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Windsor Knob Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-NEWWIN-specifications.pdf?v=1704262184\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur NEWWIN Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Newport Rosette with Windsor Knob",
                "description": "Grandeur NEWWIN, Newport Rose With Windsor Knob - The ornate styling of Newport Rosette With Windsor Knob makes it both a standout and a standard in decorative door hardware. The Windsor Knobset is a prime example of tasteful elegance. It has a stately look without being gaudy. The Newport's Rope Rosette design combined with the ornate Windsor Knob will enhance the elegance of your home in any of the beautiful finish choices. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
                "keywords": "grandeur Newport series, Windsor door knobs, grandeur door hardware,  Newport collections, ornate victorian knobs, ornate victorian style knobs, Windsor decorative Door Knobs, Grandeur NEWWIN, Ornate Victorian Style Windsor Knobs, GRA-NEWWIN, Newport Rose With Windsor Knobs, Newport Rosette With Windsor Knobs, Windsor Knob With Newport Roses"
